{"games":[{"id":118855511246658,"name":"Slam Royale","desc":"🗿 Welcome to Slam Royale  🗿\n\n\nSlam your friends in chaotic boulder battles! Swing, launch, and ragdoll your way through the arena in the goofiest, most intense fight of your life.\n\n[How To Play]\n• Equip a boulder from the display!\n• Run into battle and start swinging!\n• Attack players to build up your hit counter!\n• Unlock new boulders with unique abilities!\n\nPlay with friends, collect wild boulders, and dominate the arena 💥","path":"/game/118855511246658-slam-royale","slug":"118855511246658-slam-royale","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c83d26f88a8c166bc10ae4987bed377f/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8e6960c1207da2308bed86a311c8d14e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":19,"visitor":6547530,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-05T04:02:26.998Z","creator":{"name":"Slam Labs","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":117701570624742,"name":"Blades & Buffoonery ⚔️","desc":"- NEW BOSS\n- NEW WEAPON \n\n✨Fight people with BIG HEADS and CRAZY WEAPONS!✨\n\n👍NEW CODE AT 70K LIKES\n👍Current like code: 60KLIKES\n\n❗Game is in early development so expect many changes and rebalances❗\n\n💻 Controls:\nQ - Headbutt (Knocks people over)\nF - Ability (only on weapons that have an ability)\nE - Dash\n- Jump in the air when you're facing a wall to do a wall jump\n\n🕺EMOTE - B (PC)\n\nTags: Slap, Allblox, Tongue, Combat, Strongest, Heroes, Battles, Battlegrounds, PVP, Sword, Abilities","path":"/game/117701570624742-blades-buffoonery","slug":"117701570624742-blades-buffoonery","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5cbd1c86b60056f4e298d7d79b90bec3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-efb30dd6f2472f3510e9c7468fd33fd7/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":19,"visitor":46154655,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-06T12:42:29.580Z","creator":{"name":"Flying Gorilla","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":14,"freeCount":14,"keyCount":11,"verifiedCount":1}},{"id":12528452731,"name":"Egg Farm Tycoon","desc":"🥚 Welcome to Egg Farm Tycoon! Build your Egg Empire, produce high-quality eggs in your advanced factory, and turn them into profit! Will you become the ultimate Egg Farm Billionaire?!\n\n👥 Join our group for an exclusive +25% Cash Bonus!\nhttps://www.roblox.com/groups/13076841\n\n🏆 Premium Benefits: Enjoy a +10% Cash Bonus!\n\n🥚- Harvest Eggs from your cutting-edge Egg Factory...\n💰- Earn Cash by skillfully frying Eggs!\n💸- Invest in Upgrades to maximize the value of your Eggs!\n💖- Rebirth system for faster and easier unlocking of new Egg varieties!\n🐶- Utilize Gems to hatch adorable Pets from Pet Eggs!\n\n⚠️ Don't forget to give us a thumbs up 👍 if you enjoyed the game!\n\nTags: Egg, Farm, Farming, Factory, Tycoon, Millionaire, Billionaire\n\nPets developed by Interbyte Studios ","path":"/game/12528452731-egg-farm-tycoon","slug":"12528452731-egg-farm-tycoon","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0cbec911396f82418d8ebe3fc87c6983/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8bc5c5b44d4964b0a8dc137fde13dfdd/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":19,"visitor":33973477,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-09-05T22:38:45.199Z","creator":{"name":"Profit Prodigies","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":120830646396899,"name":"[AIKU] Project: Blue Lock","desc":"⭐ WEEKLY UPDATES EVERY TUESDAY & FRIDAY! ⭐\n\n50k Favourites for CODE!\n150k Upvotes for BONUS CODE!\n\nWelcome to Project Blue Lock!\n\nAre you ready to test your skills and compete in the most intense and thrilling soccer challenges? In here you’re part of a revolutionary training program designed to find the world's best striker. Compete in fast-paced soccer matches, improve your skills, and rise through the ranks to become the ultimate goal-scorer!\n\n⚽ Features:\n\nCompete in a challenging 5v5 match\nUnlock unique character skins, abilities, and more\nWill you make it to the top of Blue Lock and claim the title of the ultimate striker? Show your skills, dominate the field, and become the legend you’re destined to be!\n\n⚙️ Controls:\n\nW, A, S, D – Move your player around\nSpacebar – Jump\nShift – Sprint \nG – Awaken\nQ – Request Ball\nLMB – Shoot/Pass\nE - Tackle\nF - Dribble\n\nJOIN THE GROUP FOR CODES!\n\nTags: Blue Lock, Football, Soccer, Team Sports, TPS, MPS, Futbol","path":"/game/120830646396899-aiku-project-blue-lock","slug":"120830646396899-aiku-project-blue-lock","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-807c67ae72a0be183c1b09dbfe35da2e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-48ae44ed408e77c422333778ad9f99f9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":19,"visitor":15651828,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-29T13:03:34.976Z","creator":{"name":"BLOXMASTERZ","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":135118809480562,"name":"Wall Hop Test Tower","desc":"","path":"/game/135118809480562-wall-hop-test-tower","slug":"135118809480562-wall-hop-test-tower","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a04e73e40be47f9a9d6fccc57063c4cf/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9cbf4df53b6489edd2557aa1daa87983/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":19,"visitor":6428825,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-20T06:20:46.550Z","creator":{"name":"로블록스 문화부","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":2639055821,"name":"Noobs vs Zombies Tycoon 2","desc":"Noobs vs Zombies Tycoon 2 is a incomplete action-packed game where you fight for World Dominance as a Noob or as a Zombie!\r\n\r\nParticipate in these large-scaled battles by joining in on Leadership Tycoon where both nations use leaders to deploy everything they've got to eradicate their enemies from the globe: infantry, sieges, pl